                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*  PROGRAM    :  W1164000                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  MATCHAR W11643 OCH W11645-FILERNA FÖR ATT BEVAKA      *        
*                VILKA ERSÄTTNINGSMEDDELANDEN SOM SKA SKICKAS VIA      *        
*                VIPS (ÖVRIGA VÄRLDEN).                                *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  KENT JEBSEN                                           *        
*                                                                      *        
*  DATUM      :  AUGUSTI  97                                           *        
*                                                                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*        FILE SECTION                  *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11640D1                                                                   
%W11173    (W11643-)                                                            
*                                                                               
FILE W11640D2                                                                   
%W11645    (W11645-)                                                            
*                                                                               
FILE TEMPFIL  VIRTUAL RETAIN FB (9 0)                                           
TEMP-IDARTNR     1   5  P                                                       
TEMP-KDERS-OLD   6   2  P                                                       
TEMP-KDERS-NEW   8   2  P                                                       
*                                                                               
FILE W11640D4 FB (12 0)                                                         
%W11173    (W11643SORT-)                                                        
*                                                                               
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  UTFIL                               *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11640D3 FB (8 0)                                                          
%W11641    (W11641-)                                                            
*                                                                               
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  WORKING STORAGE                     *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
                                                                                
SPAR-IDARTNR     W  5 P                                                         
SPAR-KDERS-OLD   W  2 P                                                         
SPAR-KDERS-NEW   W  2 P                                                         
                                                                                
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*      JOB INPUT                       *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
*                                                                               
********SORTERAR INKOMMANDE TRANSFILEN OCH BEHANDLAR EVENTUELLA                 
*******ARTIKELNUMMERDUBBLETTER                                                  
*                                                                               
SORT W11640D1 TO W11640D4 USING (W11643-IDARTNR, W11643-IDLOPNR)                
                                                                                
JOB INPUT W11640D4                                        +                     
                                         FINISH  Z-FINIT                        
IF RECORD-COUNT = 1                                                             
  SPAR-IDARTNR   = W11643SORT-IDARTNR                                           
  SPAR-KDERS-OLD = W11643SORT-KDERS-OLD                                         
  SPAR-KDERS-NEW = W11643SORT-KDERS-NEW                                         
END-IF                                                                          
                                                                                
IF SPAR-IDARTNR = W11643SORT-IDARTNR                                            
  SPAR-KDERS-NEW = W11643SORT-KDERS-NEW                                         
ELSE                                                                            
    TEMP-IDARTNR   = SPAR-IDARTNR                                               
    TEMP-KDERS-OLD = SPAR-KDERS-OLD                                             
    TEMP-KDERS-NEW = SPAR-KDERS-NEW                                             
    PUT TEMPFIL                                                                 
  SPAR-IDARTNR   = W11643SORT-IDARTNR                                           
  SPAR-KDERS-OLD = W11643SORT-KDERS-OLD                                         
  SPAR-KDERS-NEW = W11643SORT-KDERS-NEW                                         
END-IF                                                                          
                                                                                
Z-FINIT.  PROC                                                                  
      TEMP-IDARTNR   = SPAR-IDARTNR                                             
      TEMP-KDERS-OLD = SPAR-KDERS-OLD                                           
      TEMP-KDERS-NEW = SPAR-KDERS-NEW                                           
      PUT TEMPFIL                                                               
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (TEMPFIL KEY(TEMP-IDARTNR) W11640D2 KEY(W11645-IDARTNR))              
                                                                                
IF MATCHED                                                                      
  W11641-IDARTNR                 =  W11645-IDARTNR                              
  IF TEMP-KDERS-NEW              =  W11645-KDERS                                
    W11641-KDERS                 =  W11645-KDERS                                
    W11641-FLERSATT              = 'N'                                          
    PUT W11640D3                                                                
  ELSE                                                                          
    IF TEMP-KDERS-NEW            >  0                                           
      W11641-KDERS               =  TEMP-KDERS-NEW                              
      W11641-FLERSATT            = 'N'                                          
      IF TEMP-KDERS-OLD > 20                                       +            
      AND TEMP-KDERS-NEW > 0                                                    
         W11641-FLERSATT         = 'J'                                          
      END-IF                                                                    
      PUT W11640D3                                                              
    ELSE                                                                        
      IF TEMP-KDERS-NEW          =  0                                           
        W11641-KDERS             =  TEMP-KDERS-NEW                              
        W11641-FLERSATT          =  W11645-FLERSATT                             
        PUT W11640D3                                                            
      END-IF                                                                    
    END-IF                                                                      
  END-IF                                                                        
ELSE                                                                            
  IF TEMPFIL                                                                    
**  IF TEMP-KDERS-NEW            >  0                                           
      W11641-IDARTNR             =  TEMP-IDARTNR                                
      W11641-KDERS               =  TEMP-KDERS-NEW                              
      W11641-FLERSATT            = 'N'                                          
      PUT W11640D3                                                              
**  END-IF                                                                      
  ELSE                                                                          
    IF W11640D2                                                                 
      W11641-IDARTNR             =  W11645-IDARTNR                              
      W11641-KDERS               =  W11645-KDERS                                
      W11641-FLERSATT            =  W11645-FLERSATT                             
      PUT W11640D3                                                              
    END-IF                                                                      
  END-IF                                                                        
END-IF                                                                          
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
